@startuml SD-01
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam LineColor #263E35
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #81947D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title SD-01 / UC-01 - Maintain the book catalogue
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Staff as actor
participant "BookBridge" as system
autonumber
actor -> system: Submit create, edit or listing change with book data
alt missing or non-staff identity
system --> actor: Reject access; no stored change
else staff identity
note right of system
Validate required text, non-negative price
with at most two decimals, and book
identifier when editing.
end note
alt invalid data or unknown book
system --> actor: Show specific error; preserve editable input; no change
else valid data
alt create
note right of system
Assign a unique book identifier. Initial
quantity is a non-negative integer.
end note
else edit or list/unlist
note right of system
Update basic details/listing only. Preserve
available stock and all existing reservation
prices and records.
end note
end
alt save succeeds
system --> actor: Show saved book, updated catalogue and success
else save fails
system --> actor: Show save error; no partial stored change
end
end
end
@enduml
